{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42090","headline":"壬申岁承命之任淦阳再过庐山国学感旧寄刘钧明府 · 李中","name":"壬申岁承命之任淦阳再过庐山国学感旧寄刘钧明府","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"三十年前共苦辛，囊萤曾寄此烟岑。\n读书灯暗嫌云重，搜句石平怜藓深。\n各历宦途悲聚散，几看时辈或浮沈。\n再来物景还依旧，风冷松高猨狖吟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李中","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42090.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42090","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}